कथयन्तश्च मां नित्यं तुष्यन्ति च रमन्ति च ॥ ९ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2892,\"bb\":2561,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/9/b2561/\",\"body_value\":\"mac-cittā mad-gata-prāṇā
bodhayantaḥ parasparam
kathayantaś ca māṁ nityaṁ
tuṣyanti ca ramanti ca\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":2893,\"bb\":2562,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/9/b2562/\",\"shadow_value\":\"mat-cittāḥ – their minds fully engaged in Me; mat-gata-prāṇāḥ – their lives devoted to Me; bodhayantaḥ – preaching; parasparam – among themselves; kathayantaḥ – talking; ca – also; mām – about Me; nityam – perpetually; tuṣyanti – become pleased; ca – also; ramanti – enjoy transcendental bliss; ca – also.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"mat-cittāḥ\",\"translation\":\"their minds fully engaged in Me\"},{\"word\":\"mat-gata-prāṇāḥ\",\"translation\":\"their lives devoted to Me\"},{\"word\":\"bodhayantaḥ\",\"translation\":\"preaching\"},{\"word\":\"parasparam\",\"translation\":\"among themselves\"},{\"word\":\"kathayantaḥ\",\"translation\":\"talking\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"about Me\"},{\"word\":\"nityam\",\"translation\":\"perpetually\"},{\"word\":\"tuṣyanti\",\"translation\":\"become pleased\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"ramanti\",\"translation\":\"enjoy transcendental bliss\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":2894,\"bb\":2563,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/9/b2563/\",\"body_value\":\"The thoughts of My pure devotees dwell in Me, their lives are fully devoted to My service, and they derive great satisfaction and bliss from always enlightening one another and conversing about Me.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2895,\"bb\":2564,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/9/b2564/\",\"body_value\":\"Pure devotees, whose characteristics are mentioned here, engage themselves fully in the transcendental loving service of the Lord. Their minds cannot be diverted from the lotus feet of Kṛṣṇa. Their talks are solely on the transcendental subjects. The symptoms of the pure devotees are described in this verse specifically. Devotees of the Supreme Lord are twenty-four hours daily engaged in glorifying the qualities and pastimes of the Supreme Lord. Their hearts and souls are constantly submerged in Kṛṣṇa, and they take pleasure in discussing Him with other devotees.\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2896,\"bb\":2565,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/9/b2565/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2897,\"bb\":2566,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/9/b2566/\",\"body_value\":\"The Śrīmad-Bhāgavatam is also full of such narrations about the relationship between the Supreme Lord and His devotees; therefore the Śrīmad-Bhāgavatam is very dear to the devotees, as stated in the Bhāgavatam itself (12.13.18). Śrīmad-bhāgavataṁ purāṇam amalaṁ yad vaiṣṇavānāṁ priyam. In this narration there is nothing about material activities, economic development, sense gratification or liberation. Śrīmad-Bhāgavatam is the only narration in which the transcendental nature of the Supreme Lord and His devotees is fully described. Thus the realized souls in Kṛṣṇa consciousness take continual pleasure in hearing such transcendental literatures, just as a young boy and girl take pleasure in association.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 10.9\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 10.9\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.j