ददामि बुद्धियोगं तं येन मामुपयान्ति ते ॥ १० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2900,\"bb\":2568,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/10/b2568/\",\"body_value\":\"teṣāṁ satata-yuktānāṁ
